{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YFE7qsgNEGC9mcxYcXhgVn","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→use crate::{\n     2→    systems::{\n     3→        chemistry::{photosynthetic_biomass_g, respiring_biomass_g},\n     4→        temperature::do_sat_mg_l,\n     5→    },\n     6→    types::TankState,\n     7→};\n     8→\n     9→pub fn step_dissolved_oxygen(state: &mut TankState, light_on: bool) {\n    10→    let volume_l = state.geometry.water_volume_l();\n    11→    if volume_l <= f64::EPSILON {\n    12→        return;\n    13→    }\n    14→\n    15→    let do_sat_mg_l = do_sat_mg_l(state.water.temperature_c);\n    16→    let do_mg_l = state.water.dissolved_oxygen_mg_total / volume_l;\n    17→    let aeration_intensity = if state.hardware.aeration.enabled {\n    18→        state.hardware.aeration.intensity\n    19→    } else {\n    20→        0.0\n    21→    };\n    22→    let k_la = (state.process_params.reaeration_kla_base * state.geometry.top_exchange_factor())\n    23→        + (state.process_params.aeration_kla_boost * aeration_intensity);\n    24→    let delta_do_reaeration_mg = k_la * (do_sat_mg_l - do_mg_l) * volume_l;\n    25→\n    26→    let background_bod_mg = state.process_params.background_bod_mg_o2_per_g_biomass_per_hour\n    27→        * respiring_biomass_g(state);\n    28→    let photosynthetic_o2_mg = if light_on {\n    29→        state.process_params.plant_photosynthesis_o2_mg_per_g_per_hour\n    30→            * photosynthetic_biomass_g(state)\n    31→            * state.hardware.light.intensity_index\n    32→    } else {\n    33→        0.0\n    34→    };\n    35→\n    36→    state.water.dissolved_oxygen_mg_total +=\n    37→        delta_do_reaeration_mg + photosynthetic_o2_mg - background_bod_mg;\n    38→}\n    39→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3cfb91be-a447-49cf-84b8-092d59e6712e","uuid":"8c21b94f-13a1-48a7-9df3-d321a9ca899f","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/dissolved_oxygen.rs","content":"use crate::{\n    systems::{\n        chemistry::{photosynthetic_biomass_g, respiring_biomass_g},\n        temperature::do_sat_mg_l,\n    },\n    types::TankState,\n};\n\npub fn step_dissolved_oxygen(state: &mut TankState, light_on: bool) {\n    let volume_l = state.geometry.water_volume_l();\n    if volume_l <= f64::EPSILON {\n        return;\n    }\n\n    let do_sat_mg_l = do_sat_mg_l(state.water.temperature_c);\n    let do_mg_l = state.water.dissolved_oxygen_mg_total / volume_l;\n    let aeration_intensity = if state.hardware.aeration.enabled {\n        state.hardware.aeration.intensity\n    } else {\n        0.0\n    };\n    let k_la = (state.process_params.reaeration_kla_base * state.geometry.top_exchange_factor())\n        + (state.process_params.aeration_kla_boost * aeration_intensity);\n    let delta_do_reaeration_mg = k_la * (do_sat_mg_l - do_mg_l) * volume_l;\n\n    let background_bod_mg = state.process_params.background_bod_mg_o2_per_g_biomass_per_hour\n        * respiring_biomass_g(state);\n    let photosynthetic_o2_mg = if light_on {\n        state.process_params.plant_photosynthesis_o2_mg_per_g_per_hour\n            * photosynthetic_biomass_g(state)\n            * state.hardware.light.intensity_index\n    } else {\n        0.0\n    };\n\n    state.water.dissolved_oxygen_mg_total +=\n        delta_do_reaeration_mg + photosynthetic_o2_mg - background_bod_mg;\n}\n","numLines":39,"startLine":1,"totalLines":39}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CAzfp5XvLf5HCngLd4BbXs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good - the DO system already uses `photosynthetic_biomass_g()` and `respiring_biomass_g()` which include algae, so the hourly integration coupling is correct.\n\nNow I have a thorough picture of all changes. Let me write the review.\n\n# Review: APPROVED\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Checklist\n- [x] **Daily plant growth** — `plant_growth.rs:61-72` implements `net_growth = biomass * max_rate * f_light * f_temp * min(f_n, f_p, f_c) * habitat_factor * (1 - crowding) - respiration - senescence` exactly as specified.\n- [x] **Guild-differentiated nutrient uptake** — `FastStem` uses `water_column_uptake_bias = 0.9` / `substrate_uptake_bias = 0.1`; `RootFeedingRosette` uses the inverse (`biology.rs:128-140`). Uptake removes from water column N/P and substrate stores (`plant_growth.rs:145-168`).\n- [x] **Substrate nutrient depletion** — `remove_substrate_pool()` (`plant_growth.rs:195-249`) reduces substrate N/P stores; active planted substrate starts with higher stores (test fixture at `rooted_substrate_advantage.rs:28-38` confirms 90 mg N vs 0).\n- [x] **Plant crowding and self-shading** — `crowding_index` computed from total plant biomass / surface area (`plant_growth.rs:9-15`); applied to growth formula and also used for algae shading (`algae_growth.rs:22-30`).\n- [x] **Plant habitat factor** — `RootFeedingRosette` habitat depends on substrate depth and CEC; `FastStem` gets flat 0.95 (`plant_growth.rs:110-143`).\n- [x] **Plant health tracking** — Health degrades when stress driver < 0.55, recovers otherwise; clamped 0..1 (`plant_growth.rs:87-94`).\n- [x] **Senescence to detritus** — Senescence adds to `fine_detritus_g_total` (`plant_growth.rs:85`).\n- [x] **Daily algae growth** — Suspended algae and periphyton grow based on light, temp, nutrients, reduced by plant shading and microfauna grazing (`algae_growth.rs:9-95`).\n- [x] **Periphyton surface limitation** — Capped by `total_colonizable_area_cm2` × `periphyton_capacity_g_per_m2` (`algae_growth.rs:64-73, 89`).\n- [x] **Nuisance index update** — Recalculated daily from combined suspended + periphyton pressure (`algae_growth.rs:97-108`).\n- [x] **Algae event emission** — `AlgaeRiskRising` when nuisance crosses 0.5; `AlgaeBloom` when suspended exceeds threshold; `SubstrateFoulingWarning` for high periphyton occupancy (`events.rs:56-113`).\n- [x] **Plant process parameters** — All required params added to `ProcessParams` (`process.rs:80-106`) with defaults and TOML preset values (`default.toml:50-77`).\n- [x] **Snapshot exposure** — `TankSnapshot` extended with `suspended_algae_biomass_g`, `periphyton_biomass_g`, `algae_nuisance_index`, per-guild biomass, substrate nutrient remaining (`snapshot.rs:28-32, 55-101`).\n- [x] **Acceptance test: `rooted_substrate_advantage`** — Active substrate rosette biomass asserted ≥15% higher than inert (`rooted_substrate_advantage.rs:71-74`). Test passes.\n- [x] **Acceptance test: `overfeeding_effects` (algae component)** — Overfed tank after 14 days has higher nuisance index than control (`plant_algae_integration.rs:168-172`). Test passes.\n- [x] **Integration with hourly DO/DIC pipeline** — `photosynthetic_biomass_g()` includes suspended algae + periphyton (`chemistry.rs:75-78`); `respiring_biomass_g()` includes algae (`chemistry.rs:62-73`). Hourly effects auto-scale with daily biomass changes.\n- [x] **TrimPlants action produces detritus** — Trimmed mass routed to `fine_detritus_g_total` (`engine.rs:155-163`). Confirmed by `trim_plants_routes_mass_to_detritus` test.\n- [x] **Invariants hold** — Non-negative checks for algae biomass (`invariants.rs:63-67`), substrate nutrients (`invariants.rs:68-79`), and 0..1 clamping for plant health/crowding/habitat indices (`invariants.rs:115-119`).\n\n## Notes\n- All 56 workspace tests pass after clean build. The stale `target/` build artifacts committed in the diff cause spurious compilation failures; these should be gitignored/cleaned before merge but are not a code quality issue.\n- The `photosynthetic_biomass_g()` function was correctly updated to include suspended algae, which was a pre-existing gap — good catch by the implementer.\n- Nutrient uptake gracefully falls back: if water-column nutrients are exhausted, the remaining demand spills into substrate stores (`plant_growth.rs:157-161`), preventing silent nutrient loss.\n- The `half_saturation` and `gaussian_response` helper functions are duplicated between `plant_growth.rs` and `algae_growth.rs`. Minor DRY concern but acceptable for v1.\n\n## Commit Message\nfeat(tank_core): implement daily plant growth, algae/periphyton competition, and substrate nutrient dynamics (milestone 5)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":829,"cache_read_input_tokens":83936,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":829},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3cfb91be-a447-49cf-84b8-092d59e6712e","uuid":"e08143c0-8511-42a5-93d7-eb0d18ebb67d"}
